  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 104.27 State general permits (SGPs)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 104.27 “State general permits (SGPs)” means the general permits issued by the U.S. Army Corps of Engineers (US ACE) to authorize projects in New Hampshire that:\n\n(a) Meet the conditions stated therein; and\n\n(b) Do not meet the US ACE’s critieria for individual permitting.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; renumbered by #13945 (formerly Env-Wt 104.25)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt100.html"
